           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7390-6354"))
Description: Primarily a data package that includes ICD-10-CM diagnosis and 
    ICD-10-PCS procedure codes and metadata provided by the US Centers for Medicare 
    and Medicaid Services (CMS). Additional metadata from the Healthcare Cost and 
    Utilization Project (HCUP) is also included. All datasets are in the public 
    domain. Functions to transform, filter and group codes are also included.
